        "Description": "Hello 47!\rYour targets for today: Cristina`s father is Richar Voltaire, the global businessman who created the Dionisi`s family to gain power. Second target, his asssistan is Sebastian Sato, a world-famous desinger, and you have already seen him in Paris at the 2016 fashion show, but then we cloud not kill him because he escaped. These  people are not to celebrate the discovery, but to arrange a terrorist attack, kill them before an explosion occurs and don`t let them escape. \rGood luck 47!",
